{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44246084",
      "title": "Adding Optimistic Updating",
      "sourceHash": "6b0c19aed71217baeea3b51ced017a8347906bd59bc4102e0ec90b68a206bf32",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.89,
          "en": "This year is a great example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.89,
          "end": 7.62,
          "en": "for a place in the user interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.62,
          "end": 12.03,
          "en": "where optimistic updating might be a good idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.03,
          "end": 14.76,
          "en": "Because when I press this button, we have to wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.76,
          "end": 18.75,
          "en": "for a second until this vote number goes up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.75,
          "end": 22.713,
          "en": "Now that's not horrible of course, but we can do better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "And we can do better with help of another hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 28.53,
          "en": "that's offered by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.53,
          "end": 32.49,
          "en": "and that's related to this form Actions feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.49,
          "end": 37.173,
          "en": "We can use the use optimistic hook here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.13,
          "end": 42.72,
          "en": "And use optimistic, as its name already kind of implies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42.72,
          "end": 45.15,
          "en": "is a hook that aims to help us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.15,
          "end": 47.163,
          "en": "with optimistic updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.87,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "Now how does it work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 54.6,
          "en": "Well you call it here in this case, in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.6,
          "end": 57.12,
          "en": "where I have the piece of UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.12,
          "end": 59.4,
          "en": "that should be updated optimistically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 61.803,
          "en": "So the number of votes in my case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.18,
          "end": 67.77,
          "en": "I call it here in the opinion component use optimistic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.77,
          "end": 72.483,
          "en": "And then as a first input value, it needs the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.483,
          "end": 76.263,
          "en": "that should eventually be updated optimistically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.22,
          "end": 78.84,
          "en": "In my case here, the votes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.84,
          "end": 82.11,
          "en": "which is a prop value in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.11,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "So that's the first input value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 89.76,
          "en": "It's the initial state of this optimistically managed state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.76,
          "end": 90.99,
          "en": "you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.99,
          "end": 94.56,
          "en": "Now use optimistic also takes a second parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.56,
          "end": 97.83,
          "en": "and that second parameter is a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "that will in the end be invoked by React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 104.37,
          "en": "but at a point of time defined by you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 104.37,
          "end": 105.93299999999999,
          "en": "As you will soon see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.16,
          "end": 110.22,
          "en": "Now this function will then receive a parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.22,
          "end": 113.00999999999999,
          "en": "automatically passed in by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.00999999999999,
          "end": 117,
          "en": "And the value it will receive will be the old state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117,
          "end": 118.83,
          "en": "that's managed by use optimistic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.83,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "So the state that was active before this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 126.66,
          "en": "was invoked or that is still active at the point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.66,
          "end": 127.923,
          "en": "where it's invoked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 131.82,
          "en": "In my case here, the previous votes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.82,
          "end": 135,
          "en": "Because this function then has the job",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135,
          "end": 139.32,
          "en": "of returning a new state, a new value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.32,
          "end": 142.113,
          "en": "so in my case, a new number of votes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.07,
          "end": 147.42000000000002,
          "en": "That's why here I also expect a second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.42000000000002,
          "end": 150.243,
          "en": "in this function, which I'll name mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.26,
          "end": 154.44,
          "en": "And this is now a argument that is in the unset by me,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.44,
          "end": 156.84,
          "en": "as you will soon see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 156.84,
          "end": 159.57,
          "en": "And here I expect mode to be a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 159.57,
          "end": 162.603,
          "en": "that's either up if we're up-voting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.44,
          "end": 167.4,
          "en": "in which case the new state I wanna return in this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 170.433,
          "en": "is my previous number of votes plus one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.36,
          "end": 175.62,
          "en": "Else if it's down or anything but up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.62,
          "end": 178.803,
          "en": "I wanna return previous votes minus one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.97,
          "end": 183.06,
          "en": "Now how does this mode parameter end up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 183.06,
          "end": 184.47,
          "en": "in this function though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.47,
          "end": 186.78,
          "en": "It's definitely not managed by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.78,
          "end": 188.82,
          "en": "because React doesn't know about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.82,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "which kind of values I care here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 196.02,
          "en": "Well, use optimistic, like most hooks, returns a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.02,
          "end": 198.45,
          "en": "And the value it returns is an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.45,
          "end": 202.59,
          "en": "That's why I'm again using array destructuring here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 202.59,
          "end": 205.323,
          "en": "And it's a little bit like they use state hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 206.22,
          "end": 210.87,
          "en": "Because the first value is my optimistic votes state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.87,
          "end": 211.92000000000002,
          "en": "you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.92000000000002,
          "end": 214.65,
          "en": "So it's my number of votes that's in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.65,
          "end": 216.99,
          "en": "this votes value initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.99,
          "end": 219.993,
          "en": "and that's then managed with help of this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 220.95,
          "end": 224.7,
          "en": "The second element returned by use optimistic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 224.7,
          "end": 227.73,
          "en": "or the second element in this array I should say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 227.73,
          "end": 229.92000000000002,
          "en": "is a function that we can call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.92000000000002,
          "end": 234.48,
          "en": "if we wanna invoke this optimistic updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234.48,
          "end": 238.07999999999998,
          "en": "So I'll name it, set votes optimistically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.07999999999998,
          "end": 241.41,
          "en": "though the names of course are up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 241.41,
          "end": 244.77,
          "en": "Now this function, set votes optimistically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.77,
          "end": 248.91,
          "en": "can be called in any form action of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.91,
          "end": 250.26,
          "en": "That's the idea behind it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.26,
          "end": 253.11,
          "en": "It should be called inside of a form action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 253.11,
          "end": 256.95,
          "en": "because use optimistic is meant to be used in conjunction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 256.95,
          "end": 259.17,
          "en": "with form actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 259.17,
          "end": 263.07,
          "en": "Because the state produced by use optimistic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 263.07,
          "end": 267.75,
          "en": "my optimistic votes in this case, will be a temporary state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 267.75,
          "end": 272.31,
          "en": "you could say, that's only shown on the UI whilst the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 272.31,
          "end": 277.31,
          "en": "that invoked this optimistic function is being submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.92,
          "end": 280.5,
          "en": "And thereafter this state will be thrown away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.5,
          "end": 283.95,
          "en": "and the actual UI state that is applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 283.95,
          "end": 286.35,
          "en": "by some other code in your application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 286.35,
          "end": 288.54,
          "en": "will become active again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 288.54,
          "end": 291.48,
          "en": "So it's just about having a temporary value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 291.48,
          "end": 293.64,
          "en": "whilst the form is being submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 293.64,
          "end": 297.63,
          "en": "That's the idea behind this use Optimistic hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 297.63,
          "end": 301.26,
          "en": "But it's now this function which you can call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 301.26,
          "end": 304.05,
          "en": "to invoke this function, which you passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 304.05,
          "end": 306.783,
          "en": "as a second argument to use optimistic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 307.77,
          "end": 311.28,
          "en": "And any values, any arguments you pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 311.28,
          "end": 315.18,
          "en": "to set votes optimistically will be passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 315.18,
          "end": 320.18,
          "en": "as parameters to this state updating function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 320.79,
          "end": 323.16,
          "en": "after this first parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 323.16,
          "end": 327.48,
          "en": "So this first parameter here will always be passed in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 327.48,
          "end": 330.84,
          "en": "by React and it will always be the previous state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 330.84,
          "end": 335.46,
          "en": "but any other parameters thereafter are simply the arguments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 335.46,
          "end": 338.07,
          "en": "you pass to this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 338.07,
          "end": 340.74,
          "en": "So if you pass no arguments to this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 340.74,
          "end": 343.11,
          "en": "you will get no extra arguments here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 343.11,
          "end": 346.38,
          "en": "If you pass 10 arguments to this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 346.38,
          "end": 349.11,
          "en": "you will get 10 arguments here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 349.11,
          "end": 351.9,
          "en": "So that's how this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 351.9,
          "end": 356.07,
          "en": "In my case, I plan on passing one argument to this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 356.07,
          "end": 358.8,
          "en": "and that will be that mode, which should be a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 358.8,
          "end": 360.633,
          "en": "that's either up or down.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 362.01,
          "end": 365.523,
          "en": "So where should this function be called then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 366.63,
          "end": 371.1,
          "en": "Well in these form actions when the form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 371.1,
          "end": 375.3,
          "en": "but before we call up mode or download opinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 375.3,
          "end": 379.983,
          "en": "So before we send that request and wait for its response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 381.06,
          "end": 384.3,
          "en": "So it's here where I'll call set votes optimistically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 384.3,
          "end": 387.96,
          "en": "and pass up to it, and then download action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 387.96,
          "end": 389.793,
          "en": "I'll pass down to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 391.2,
          "end": 392.49,
          "en": "And that's all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 392.49,
          "end": 395.1,
          "en": "This function doesn't return anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 395.1,
          "end": 397.92,
          "en": "Instead this optimistic votes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 397.92,
          "end": 401.37,
          "en": "this state will be updated automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 401.37,
          "end": 403.59000000000003,
          "en": "when we call this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 403.59000000000003,
          "end": 406.65,
          "en": "Because this function here will then execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 406.65,
          "end": 410.52,
          "en": "and produce a new optimistic votes value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 410.52,
          "end": 413.15999999999997,
          "en": "And then this component function will re-execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 413.15999999999997,
          "end": 416.7,
          "en": "just as it does with use state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 416.7,
          "end": 419.1,
          "en": "And therefore it's now the optimistic votes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 419.1,
          "end": 422.91,
          "en": "which we can and should use here in our JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 422.91,
          "end": 424.98,
          "en": "in this span.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 424.98,
          "end": 429.3,
          "en": "Like this, and the idea now simply is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 429.3,
          "end": 432.18,
          "en": "that these votes will change instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 432.18,
          "end": 434.58,
          "en": "when this function is called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 434.58,
          "end": 437.31,
          "en": "And then we sent the request thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 437.31,
          "end": 440.19,
          "en": "And the great thing about use optimistic is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 440.19,
          "end": 444.24,
          "en": "that it will understand in which action it's being invoked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 444.24,
          "end": 445.073,
          "en": "in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 446.01,
          "end": 450.24,
          "en": "So that is meant to be called inside of form actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 450.24,
          "end": 453.63,
          "en": "Just to be clear, you should invoke this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 453.63,
          "end": 455.223,
          "en": "from inside of form action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 456.63,
          "end": 460.59000000000003,
          "en": "And use optimistic then registers that and waits for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 460.59000000000003,
          "end": 462.243,
          "en": "that action to complete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 463.26,
          "end": 467.25,
          "en": "And once the action completed, it will get rid of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 467.25,
          "end": 469.17,
          "en": "this optimistic state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 469.17,
          "end": 472.29,
          "en": "and instead apply the regular UI state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 472.29,
          "end": 474.303,
          "en": "that would've been applied anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 475.2,
          "end": 477.39,
          "en": "So the value that's produced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 477.39,
          "end": 480.84,
          "en": "by use optimistic is only shown whilst",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 480.84,
          "end": 482.553,
          "en": "the form is being submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 483.39,
          "end": 486.36,
          "en": "That's the idea behind use optimistic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 486.36,
          "end": 489.78,
          "en": "It gives us a temporary value that's shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 489.78,
          "end": 492.183,
          "en": "as long as the form is being submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 493.26,
          "end": 498.06,
          "en": "But therefore with that logic added, if you save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 498.06,
          "end": 501.12,
          "en": "if you reload and you up upload, you see this changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 501.12,
          "end": 502.443,
          "en": "to a one instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 503.94,
          "end": 505.44,
          "en": "And that's therefore now of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 505.44,
          "end": 508.98,
          "en": "a way better user experience because this ensures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 508.98,
          "end": 511.47,
          "en": "that we now update the UI instantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 511.47,
          "end": 514.653,
          "en": "but behind the scenes the process takes a bit longer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 515.73,
          "end": 518.64,
          "en": "Now, if the update were to fail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 518.64,
          "end": 522.3,
          "en": "because for example, in the backend code we had an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 522.3,
          "end": 526.35,
          "en": "and to simulate that, I'll go here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 526.35,
          "end": 529.03,
          "en": "in my upvote endpoint in the backend code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 530.07,
          "end": 533.61,
          "en": "and I'll return a response here where I set the status code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 533.61,
          "end": 536.46,
          "en": "to 500 like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 536.46,
          "end": 540.78,
          "en": "So that I always return an error response here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 540.78,
          "end": 542.97,
          "en": "and I then stop that backend server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 542.97,
          "end": 546.963,
          "en": "and restart it so that this updated code is picked up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 548.34,
          "end": 551.25,
          "en": "If I do that, you'll see that now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 551.25,
          "end": 554.07,
          "en": "when you upload it still updates instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 554.07,
          "end": 557.913,
          "en": "optimistically, but then it rolls back to the old value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 558.96,
          "end": 562.26,
          "en": "Because again, use optimistic only gives you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 562.26,
          "end": 564.21,
          "en": "this temporary value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 564.21,
          "end": 565.443,
          "en": "That's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 566.79,
          "end": 569.67,
          "en": "Now, with that, I'll get rid of this error in the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 569.67,
          "end": 573.3,
          "en": "because I don't want it, it was just a demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 573.3,
          "end": 575.32,
          "en": "And I'll restart my backend server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 576.45,
          "end": 578.46,
          "en": "so that everything works again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 578.46,
          "end": 581.85,
          "en": "But that's now use optimistic in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 581.85,
          "end": 584.34,
          "en": "Another hook that can be quite useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 584.34,
          "end": 586.443,
          "en": "when working with form actions.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
